# Copy to .dev.vars for local development (.dev.vars is git-ignored).
# Add local-only secrets here as KEY=value when they are needed.

# Optional settings; see docs/configuration.md. Defaults apply when unset.
# Minutes after the event's start when bookings close (negative = earlier). Default 0.
# BOOKING_CUTOFF_OFFSET_MINUTES=-30
# Plain-text privacy notice shown on the booking form; \n\n starts a new paragraph. Default: see the docs.
# PRIVACY_NOTICE="We use your details to run the event.\n\nEmail us to have them deleted."
